{
  "slug": "skill-memo",
  "name": "Skill Memo",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A CLI tool for managing Claude Code skills and MCP servers catalog with memo support. Auto-detects installed MCP servers from settings.json and skills from ~/.claude/skills/, supports manual registration, memo management per skill/server, and provides a filterable table display. Integrates with Claude Code via /catalog slash command. Zero dependencies, Node.js 18+ only, MIT license.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **8 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `catalog` (Display installed skills and MCP servers catalog with memos and tags)\n- **Commands** (8): `catalog-add` (Manually add an entry to the catalog), `catalog-export` (Export catalog), `catalog-memo` (Update memo for a catalog entry), `catalog-remove` (Remove a catalog entry), `catalog-search` (Search catalog entries), `catalog-sync` (Auto-detect and sync skills/MCP servers from settings.json), `catalog-tag` (Set tags for a catalog entry), `catalog` (Display installed skills and MCP servers catalog)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install skill-memo@claude-community` from `aliksir/skill-memo`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
